AFTER START: {"engineOn":false,"driving":false,"fuel":0,"tasks":{"keys":true},"toast":"Tidak bisa dinyalakanKurang: engine, gearbox, radiator, battery, hood, 4 roda"}
AFTER DRIVE: {"pos":[0,0,1.2],"speed":0,"fuel":0}
AT STORE: {"pos":[104,0,164],"speed":0,"toast":"Tidak bisa dinyalakanKurang: engine, gearbox, radiator, battery, hood, 4 roda"}
EXITED: {"driving":false,"cam":[0,1.62,7.19],"parent":"Scene"}
ERRORS: none

Only 'keys' got done — the part pickups/install didn't work! pick('keys') worked (task keys true). But pick('engine') etc did nothing. Why? tryInteract: `if (!started || busy>0) return;` — started ✓. Then `const iid = hoverIid;` = 'engine' ✓. `if (iid==='keys')`... `const p = partById(iid); if (p && p.state==='loose' && !carrying)` → pickupPart('engine') → should work... unless carrying==='keys' already! YES — keys picked FIRST → carrying='keys' → `!carrying` false → skip → falls to `iid==='car'` no → nothing!

